  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Albania National Water Supply and Sanitation Sector Modernization Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;1. Objectives
 The objectives of the Albania National Water Supply and Sanitation Sector Modernization Program (the &#x201c;Program&#x201d;) supported by the Trust Fund are to: (a) improve operational and financial performance of water supply and sanitation utilities; and (b) increase access to safely managed water services in Albania.&quot;</narrative>
